{"name":"Team Spirit","hex":"#416986","fetched":"2026-10-13","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"team spirit","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["Camaraderie; willingness to co-operate with others."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/team_spirit"}],"entries":[{"title":"Team Spirit","blocks":[{"text":"Team Spirit was a joint military training exercise of United States Forces Korea and the Military of South Korea held between 1974 and 1993. The exercise was also scheduled from 1994 to 1996 but cancelled during this time period as part of diplomatic efforts to encourage the Government of North Korea to disable the North Korean nuclear weapons program. The North Korea regime abandoned talks following the January 1986 Team Spirit exercises, and in late 1992, North Korea unilaterally withdrew from the South-North High-Level Talks due to the 1993 Team Spirit exercise."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0d/ROKAF_and_USAF_fighters_during_Team_Spirit_84.JPEG/330px-ROKAF_and_USAF_fighters_during_Team_Spirit_84.JPEG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Team_Spirit"},{"title":"Team Spirit (esports)","blocks":[{"text":"Team Spirit is a European esports organization based in Belgrade, Serbia. Founded in 2015, the organization currently has teams competing in Counter-Strike 2, Dota 2, Hearthstone, Pubg Mobile and Mobile Legends: Bang Bang. Their Dota 2 squad won three iterations of The International, with the organization after winning their first title receiving the largest single prize money payout in esports history at $18 million. In 2022, as a result of the ongoing Russian invasion of Ukraine, the organization relocated from Moscow, Russia to Belgrade, Serbia."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f5/Team_Spirit_new_em.svg/330px-Team_Spirit_new_em.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Team_Spirit_(esports)"},{"title":"Team building","blocks":[{"text":"Team building is a collective term for various interventions that improve team effectiveness and define roles within teams, often involving collaborative tasks. It is distinct from team training, which is designed by a combination of business managers, learning and development/OD and an HR Business Partner to improve the efficiency, rather than interpersonal relations."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b0/US_Navy_040518-N-9693M-015_A_squad_of_Midshipmen_work_with_a_log_as_part_of_teamwork_training_during_Sea_Trials.jpg/330px-US_Navy_040518-N-9693M-015_A_squad_of_Midshipmen_work_with_a_log_as_part_of_teamwork_training_during_Sea_Trials.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Team_building"},{"title":"Team","blocks":[{"text":"A team is a group of individuals working together to achieve their goal."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/00/Team_work.jpg/330px-Team_work.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Team"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/68/Monts-merveilles.fr_teambuilding.jpg/500px-Monts-merveilles.fr_teambuilding.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/68/Monts-merveilles.fr_teambuilding.jpg/1280px-Monts-merveilles.fr_teambuilding.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/68/Monts-merveilles.fr_teambuilding.jpg/500px-Monts-merveilles.fr_teambuilding.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"These teams have built small ocean-going rafts as part of a team-building exercise.","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AMonts-merveilles.fr_teambuilding.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/95/Team_building_strategies_as_described_by_Klein.png/500px-Team_building_strategies_as_described_by_Klein.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/95/Team_building_strategies_as_described_by_Klein.png/500px-Team_building_strategies_as_described_by_Klein.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Effects of team building strategies on all four outcomes, with 10% and 90% credibility intervals[12]\n","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ATeam_building_strategies_as_described_by_Klein.png"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f7/Type_91_SAM_fire.JPG/500px-Type_91_SAM_fire.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f7/Type_91_SAM_fire.JPG/1280px-Type_91_SAM_fire.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f7/Type_91_SAM_fire.JPG/500px-Type_91_SAM_fire.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"A Japan Air Self-Defense Force (JASDF) team looks on after the Type 91 Kai MANPAD fires a rocket at a mock airborne target.","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AType_91_SAM_fire.JPG"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0b/Rugby_union_scrummage.jpg/500px-Rugby_union_scrummage.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0b/Rugby_union_scrummage.jpg/1280px-Rugby_union_scrummage.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0b/Rugby_union_scrummage.jpg/500px